package com.sliverzfx.gothicquest
object Gothic2Chapter2Data {
val quests = listOf(
g2later("G2G-C02-008",2,1,"Fernando's Business","Side Quest","Khorinis / Valley of Mines","General","Stage 1 — New Chapter 2 errands in Khorinis","Find out what happened to Fernando’s ore business.","If Fernando is still free in Chapter 2, ask about his business. Investigate the ore situation during the Valley of Mines trip, then return with news.","Unavailable if you already exposed Fernando in The Bandit’s Arms Dealer."),
g2later("G2G-C02-035",2,2,"The Message","Side Quest","Khorinis / Monastery road","General","Stage 1 — New Chapter 2 errands in Khorinis","Carry Vatras’s message to Isgaroth and return with the response.","Speak to Vatras in Chapter 2. Deliver his sealed message to Isgaroth at the roadside shrine near the monastery, then return to Vatras.","A fast messenger quest with several possible reward choices."),
g2later("G2G-C02-004",2,3,"A Sextant","Side Quest","Khorinis / Jharkendar","Thieves’ Guild","Stage 1 — New Chapter 2 errands in Khorinis","Bring Ramirez a sextant.","Accept the request from Ramirez in the sewers. Find a sextant during exploration—Jharkendar/pirate loot provides one reliably—then return it to Ramirez.","Can be completed later if you do not find the item immediately."),
g2later("G2G-C02-024",2,4,"Snapper Claws","Side Quest","Khorinis / Valley of Mines","General","Stage 1 — New Chapter 2 errands in Khorinis","Bring Lutero the special claws of a snapper pack leader.","Accept Lutero’s request in the Upper Quarter. During Snapper Hunt in the Valley, identify and kill the pack leader, take its special claws, and return them to Lutero.","Do not leave the Valley without looting the leader."),
g2later("G2G-C02-007",2,5,"Black Fur","Side Quest","Onar’s Farm / Black Troll area","Mercenaries","Stage 1 — New Chapter 2 errands in Khorinis","Bring Raoul the hide of the black troll.","Accept Raoul’s challenge. Kill the black troll if you have not already, take its black hide, and bring it to Raoul. Decide how to handle his payment/boasting afterward.","Pairs with Chapter 1’s The Snorting Creature."),
g2later("G2G-C02-032",2,6,"The Crawler Armor","Side Quest","Valley of Mines / Onar’s Farm","General","Stage 1 — New Chapter 2 errands in Khorinis","Have Wolf craft armor from minecrawler plates.","Learn from Gestath that crawler-plate armor is possible. Acquire enough Minecrawler Plates, return to Wolf on Onar’s farm and ask him to craft the armor.","Requires the ability to remove minecrawler plates before you can gather them."),
g2later("G2G-C02-005",2,7,"Bad News","Side Quest","Valley of Mines","General","Stage 2 — Enter the Valley of Mines and reach the castle","Tell Oric/Udar’s circle about the dead paladin discovered outside the castle.","Meet Jergan on the path into the Valley and inspect the dead Paladin he mentions. Reach the castle and deliver the bad news to the appropriate brother/comrade.","Easy to miss if you sprint past Jergan on the first approach."),
g2later("G2G-C02-027",2,8,"Support for Marcos","Side Quest","Valley of Mines","General","Stage 2 — Enter the Valley of Mines and reach the castle","Tell Garond where Marcos and the ore shipment are hiding.","Find Marcos in the cave west of the castle after following the ore trail. Speak to him, then return to Garond with his position/status.","Part of Miners and Ore."),
g2later("G2G-C02-016",2,9,"Lurkers at the River","Side Quest","Valley of Mines","General","Stage 2 — Enter the Valley of Mines and reach the castle","Kill the lurkers threatening Kervo’s hiding place.","Find Kervo in the cave near the river/waterfall. Kill the lurkers he points out and return to him.","Small Valley side quest."),
g2later("G2G-C02-033",2,10,"The Liberation of Gorn","Side Quest","Valley of Mines – Castle","General","Stage 2 — Enter the Valley of Mines and reach the castle","Free Gorn from Garond’s prison.","Speak to Milten/Gorn and learn the required fine. Raise the necessary gold or use the available dialogue help from friends, pay Garond, then speak to the freed Gorn.","One of the most expensive early Chapter 2 side quests but gives strong rewards/armor depending on faction."),
g2later("G2G-C02-018",2,11,"Meat","Side Quest","Valley of Mines – Castle","General","Stage 2 — Enter the Valley of Mines and reach the castle","Bring Engor enough meat to improve the castle’s food supply.","Speak to Engor. Gather 24 pieces of raw meat and deliver them to him.","Stockpile meat before entering the Valley to finish instantly."),
g2later("G2G-C02-011",2,12,"Gold for Brutus","Side Quest","Valley of Mines – Castle","General","Stage 2 — Enter the Valley of Mines and reach the castle","Recover Brutus’s stolen/misplaced gold.","Speak to Brutus in the castle. Search the nearby quarters/chests or culprit he identifies, recover the gold and return it.","Small castle side quest."),
g2later("G2G-C02-020",2,13,"Miners and Ore","Main Quest","Valley of Mines","Main quest","Stage 3 — The three mining sites and Garond’s proof","Report the status and ore output of all three mining expeditions to Garond.","Speak to Garond in the castle. Visit the three mining sites led by Marcos, Fajeth and Silvestro’s group, learn each shipment/status and survive the local threats. Return to Garond with all reports.","Completing all three reports is required to obtain the written Evidence for Lord Hagen."),
g2later("G2G-C02-025",2,14,"Snapper Hunt","Side Quest","Valley of Mines","General","Stage 3 — The three mining sites and Garond’s proof","Clear the snapper pack threatening Fajeth’s mining camp.","Speak to Fajeth. Kill the snappers around the mine, including the pack leader if available, then report back.","Talk to Bilgot before/afterward to open Bilgot’s Escape; the leader’s claws satisfy Lutero’s quest."),
g2later("G2G-C02-006",2,15,"Bilgot's Escape","Side Quest","Valley of Mines","General","Stage 3 — The three mining sites and Garond’s proof","Escort Bilgot safely away from Fajeth’s mine.","Speak to Bilgot after accepting/finishing Snapper Hunt. Clear the route toward the pass in advance, then escort him past the orc-infested territory to the agreed safe point.","Escort quests are fragile; clear monsters first and save before starting."),
g2later("G2G-C02-029",2,16,"Tengron's Ring","Side Quest","Valley of Mines","General","Stage 3 — The three mining sites and Garond’s proof","Deliver Tengron’s ring to Udar.","Talk to Tengron at Fajeth’s mine. Carry the ring to Udar at the castle and deliver it.","Easy to combine with Miners and Ore."),
g2later("G2G-C02-040",2,17,"The Sunken City","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Water Mage ruins","Night of the Raven","Stage 4 — Jharkendar: Water Mage camp and first exploration","Learn the history of Jharkendar’s destruction.","Speak with Nefarius about the records. Ask Saturas about the flood, civil war and the fates of Quarhodron/Rhademes, then return if the journal requires it.","Mostly a lore/dialogue quest."),
g2later("G2G-C02-042",2,18,"The Vanguard of the Water Mages","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Swamp","Night of the Raven","Stage 4 — Jharkendar: Water Mage camp and first exploration","Find the missing Ring of Water scout Lance.","Ask Saturas about Lance. Search the swamp near the ruins, find Lance’s body, take his ring and report the death to Saturas.","Lance’s body is close to other early swamp objectives."),
g2later("G2G-C02-034",2,19,"The Mansions of the Builders","Side Quest","Jharkendar","Night of the Raven","Stage 4 — Jharkendar: Water Mage camp and first exploration","Explore all five caste mansions and recover their colored relic tablets.","After Saturas/Riordian explains the Council of Five, visit the mansions of the Scholars, Warriors, Priests, Healers and Guardians of the Dead. Clear each ruin and recover its colored tablet.","The tablets feed the Relics quest and provide clues for the Temple of Adanos."),
g2later("G2G-C02-038",2,20,"The Power of the Focus Stones","Side Quest","Jharkendar","Night of the Raven","Stage 4 — Jharkendar: Water Mage camp and first exploration","Activate Jharkendar’s five teleporter stations.","Get focus stones/keys from Merdarion as the quest advances. Visit each regional teleporter pedestal, place/activate the focus mechanism and use the teleporter. Return to Merdarion after activations for updates/rewards.","Activating two stations triggers further information about the Builders’ mansions."),
g2later("G2G-C02-037",2,21,"The Orcs in the Canyon","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Canyon","Night of the Raven","Stage 4 — Jharkendar: Water Mage camp and first exploration","Destroy the orc force occupying the canyon.","Take Riordian’s request. Enter the canyon, clear the orcs around the ruins/library and return to Riordian.","Combine with Razor Hunt and the Scholars’ mansion to avoid repeated trips."),
g2later("G2G-C02-021",2,22,"Rat Hunt","Side Quest","Jharkendar","Night of the Raven","Stage 5 — Jharkendar: Pirate Camp","Help Alligator Jack hunt giant rats and earn his trust.","Meet Alligator Jack west of the Water Mages. Follow him on the hunt, kill the rats he leads you to, collect the meat, and speak to him afterward.","Leads naturally into Meat for Morgan and entry to the pirate camp."),
g2later("G2G-C02-019",2,23,"Meat for Morgan","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Pirate Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 5 — Jharkendar: Pirate Camp","Deliver Alligator Jack’s meat to Morgan.","After Rat Hunt, take the meat from Alligator Jack. Find Morgan at/near the pirate camp and hand it over.","Completes a short chain with Alligator Jack."),
g2later("G2G-C02-041",2,24,"The Tower","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Pirate Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 5 — Jharkendar: Pirate Camp","Clear bandits from the tower south of the pirate camp.","Take Henry’s request, travel to the occupied tower, kill the hostile bandits and return to Henry.","Can be combined with treasure exploration south of camp."),
g2later("G2G-C02-044",2,25,"Wood for the Palisade","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Pirate Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 5 — Jharkendar: Pirate Camp","Check on the woodcutters and secure timber for Henry’s palisade.","Speak to Henry at the camp gate. Find the woodcutters in/near the cave, deal with the monsters or problem stopping them, then report back to Henry.","Completing pirate-camp chores can reduce entry costs/improve standing."),
g2later("G2G-C02-017",2,26,"Malcom","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Pirate Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 5 — Jharkendar: Pirate Camp","Find out what happened to the missing pirate Malcom.","Talk to Owen. Search the nearby cave/coast where Malcom disappeared, investigate the creatures and his remains/possessions, then report back to Owen.","The route involves a dangerous drop/cave area; save before exploring."),
g2later("G2G-C02-031",2,27,"The Beach in the North","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Pirate Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 5 — Jharkendar: Pirate Camp","Clear the monsters from the northern beach.","Take Morgan’s request. Travel to the north beach, kill the creatures occupying it and return to Morgan.","Useful area for loot and exploration once cleared."),
g2later("G2G-C02-012",2,28,"Grog for the Cook","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Pirate/Bandit camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 5 — Jharkendar: Pirate Camp","Bring the thirsty cook some grog.","Talk to the cook, hand over the required bottle(s) of grog, and finish the conversation.","Simple supply quest; keep spare grog while exploring Jharkendar."),
g2later("G2G-C02-009",2,29,"Garett's Compass","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Pirate Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 5 — Jharkendar: Pirate Camp","Recover Garett’s valuable compass from one of Greg’s buried caches.","Talk to Garett. Use Greg’s treasure map/clues to locate the correct buried chest, dig it up, take the compass and return it.","A shovel is required for buried treasure spots."),
g2later("G2G-C02-001",2,30,"A Drink for Brandon","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Pirate Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 5 — Jharkendar: Pirate Camp","Bring Brandon the drink he wants before asking him for training.","Speak to Brandon in the pirate camp. Obtain the requested strong drink (not just ordinary grog if he specifies something better), give it to him and continue the conversation.","Unlocks training from Brandon."),
g2later("G2G-C02-023",2,31,"Skip is Out of Rum","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Pirate Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 5 — Jharkendar: Pirate Camp","Find the missing rum/grog shipment Skip expected from Angus and Hank.","Speak to Skip. Investigate Angus and Hank’s disappearance, recover the trade goods from their killer, and return the alcohol/answer to Skip.","Overlaps The Murderer of Angus and Hank."),
g2later("G2G-C02-036",2,32,"The Murderer of Angus and Hank","Side Quest","Jharkendar","Night of the Raven","Stage 5 — Jharkendar: Pirate Camp","Find and kill the man who murdered the two pirates.","Learn from Bill/Morgan that Angus and Hank are missing. Track their trade route into the swamp/caves, find their bodies and evidence, locate Juan, defeat him, recover the stolen goods, and report back.","Also resolves parts of Skip is Out of Rum and Huno’s Steel."),
g2later("G2G-C02-022",2,33,"Razor Hunt","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Canyon","Night of the Raven","Stage 5 — Jharkendar: Pirate Camp","Reduce the razor population threatening the pirate camp.","Speak to Greg after reaching the pirate camp. Enter the canyon with the assigned pirates if offered, kill the required razors and report back.","Clear orcs carefully; the canyon holds several other quests and mansion relics."),
g2later("G2G-C02-026",2,34,"Spying on the Bandits","Side Quest","Jharkendar","Night of the Raven","Stage 5 — Jharkendar: Pirate Camp","Gather intelligence inside Raven’s camp for Greg.","Once you have bandit armor, accept Greg’s spying task. Infiltrate the camp, learn why the bandits are mining and what Raven is doing, then return to Greg with the intelligence.","Keep the disguise equipped in restricted areas."),
g2later("G2G-C02-010",2,35,"Getting Inside the Bandit Camp","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Swamp","Night of the Raven","Stage 6 — Jharkendar: swamp and entry to the Bandit Camp","Earn passage through the outer swamp camp into Raven’s main bandit settlement.","Approach the hunters in the swamp and speak to Sancho/Franco. Complete the required jobs such as Swamp Shark Hunt and The Stone Tablet in the Swamp, then deal with Franco’s attempt to block you and secure permission to pass.","Bandit armor is still required to move safely through the main camp."),
g2later("G2G-C02-028",2,36,"Swamp Shark Hunt","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Swamp","Night of the Raven","Stage 6 — Jharkendar: swamp and entry to the Bandit Camp","Help Logan kill swamp sharks to prove your usefulness.","Speak to Franco/Sancho and then Logan. Join the hunt, kill the required swamp sharks and report completion.","One of the outer-camp tasks needed for access to the bandit camp."),
g2later("G2G-C02-039",2,37,"The Stone Tablet in the Swamp","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Swamp","Night of the Raven","Stage 6 — Jharkendar: swamp and entry to the Bandit Camp","Retrieve the ancient tablet Franco demands.","Accept the task from Franco. Search the swamp ruin/stone structure he indicates, fight through the local monsters, recover the tablet and bring it back.","Part of the access chain to the main bandit camp."),
g2later("G2G-C02-002",2,38,"A Fateful Situation","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Bandit Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 7 — Jharkendar: Bandit Camp intrigue","Deal with Senyan after he recognizes you as an outsider.","Speak to Senyan after entering the bandit camp in disguise. He tries to use what he knows against you; refuse to be controlled and defeat him when the confrontation turns violent.","Keep your bandit armor on around the camp until you are safely accepted."),
g2later("G2G-C02-030",2,39,"The Assassination","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Bandit Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 7 — Jharkendar: Bandit Camp intrigue","Discover who tried to assassinate Esteban.","Speak to Esteban and question camp residents. Follow clues through Huno, Fisk, Snaf and the missing goods; locate Juan and recover evidence. Confront the conspirators/Esteban as the investigation develops, defeat Esteban when the power struggle comes to a head, then report to Thorus.","Major bandit-camp chain; complete side errands for evidence before killing key NPCs."),
g2later("G2G-C02-015",2,40,"Intellectual Aberrations","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Bandit Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 7 — Jharkendar: Bandit Camp intrigue","Restore Fortuno’s memory so he can explain what Raven has been doing.","Speak to the confused Fortuno. Get him a Green Novice and follow the alchemy clues needed for the memory-restoring potion. Give him the treatment, question him thoroughly, then report important information to Saturas.","Older guides may call this “Mental Meanders” or similar depending on translation."),
g2later("G2G-C02-013",2,41,"Hammer Schnapps","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Bandit Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 7 — Jharkendar: Bandit Camp intrigue","Help Snaf produce his special Hammer Schnapps.","Speak to Snaf and learn the recipe/ingredients. Gather the required components, bring them to him or brew as instructed, then return for the result.","Camp crafting side quest."),
g2later("G2G-C02-014",2,42,"Huno's Steel","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Bandit Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 7 — Jharkendar: Bandit Camp intrigue","Recover Huno’s steel shipment.","Receive the task while investigating Esteban’s assassination. Track the missing steel to Juan/the cave outside the camp, defeat or confront the thieves, recover the steel and return it to Huno.","Ties directly into the evidence against Esteban’s enemies."),
g2later("G2G-C02-003",2,43,"A Package of Lockpicks","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Bandit Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 7 — Jharkendar: Bandit Camp intrigue","Recover Fisk’s stolen lockpick shipment.","Speak to Fisk. Follow the clues to the thief/holder of the package, recover the lockpicks and return them to Fisk.","Can intersect with the camp’s internal power struggle and assassination chain."),
g2later("G2G-C02-043",2,44,"Three Stones - Three Diggers","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Bandit Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 7 — Jharkendar: Bandit Camp intrigue","Reassign diggers after Esteban’s death.","After the assassination chain, speak to Thorus. Talk to the relevant miners/diggers and assign or direct three workers to the required digging spots, then report completion.","Post-Esteban camp-management quest.")
)
